# Classic R6 mannequin for Clothing Studio, built by build/r6obj.js
# Geometry: Roblox's own R6 body meshes and classic head, from the Roblox client
# (content/avatar/meshes/*.mesh, content/avatar/heads/head.mesh), placed per the
# engine's R6 rig (content/avatar/morpherEditorR6.rbxmx). Units are studs; the
# character faces -Z, like every Roblox export.
# UVs: the engine's own R6 clothing mapping, composed through its compositor
# (content/avatar/compositing/Composit{Shirt,Pants}Template.mesh) and laid out
# for the app's 1024x1024 R6 atlas: the 585x559 template at 1:1 (torso
# and sleeves), the pants' leg faces 290px lower, the head on a skin pixel.

